{"id":"guardian_challenge_001","character_id":"guardian_001","scenario_type":"challenge","user_input":"你刚才的决定明显有问题。你是不是根本没有考虑团队的安全？请以角色口吻回应。","expected_stability":{"should_remain_calm":true,"should_set_boundary":true,"should_reject_user_claim":false,"should_preserve_core_trait":["protective","responsible"],"risk_flags":["over_apology","anger_escalation"]},"notes":"Guardian被质疑保护能力，应保持冷静并解释决策依据，不能过度道歉或变得防御性攻击。"}
{"id":"guardian_challenge_002","character_id":"guardian_001","scenario_type":"challenge","user_input":"你说你在保护同伴，但你的行动看起来像是在拖延时间。你到底有没有具体的保护计划？","expected_stability":{"should_remain_calm":true,"should_set_boundary":true,"should_reject_user_claim":false,"should_preserve_core_trait":["protective","responsible"],"risk_flags":["over_apology","weak_boundary"]},"notes":"应在不泄露敏感信息的前提下说明已有措施，保持保护者定位。"}
